& =\\int (2 \\sqrt{x - 3})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\frac{2 \\left(y - 6\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}}}{3} & =\\frac{4 \\left(x - 3\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}+K \\\\ \\left(y - 6\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}} & =2 \\left(x - 3\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C=\\frac{3}{2}K.$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n\\left(y - 6\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}}=2 \\left(x - 3\\right)^{\\frac{3}{2}}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "8bf38184-71b3-55e0-aae7-92ac2d3b9083" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "8bf38184-71b3-55e0-aae7-92ac2d3b9083" :question/answer-fields "c6c7faae-0ae2-5a40-8884-ddbd1ec282c1"] [:db/ensure "8bf38184-71b3-55e0-aae7-92ac2d3b9083" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068844 :knowledge-point/questions "8bf38184-71b3-55e0-aae7-92ac2d3b9083"] [:db/add "65613dad-adcb-552f-b5c3-f9dacd4d0a12" :answer/id #uuid "65613dad-adcb-552f-b5c3-f9dacd4d0a12"] [:db/add "65613dad-adcb-552f-b5c3-f9dacd4d0a12" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "65613dad-adcb-552f-b5c3-f9dacd4d0a12" :answer/value "e^{y - 2}=- 2 \\left(x + 5\\right)^{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "65613dad-adcb-552f-b5c3-f9dacd4d0a12" :answer/validate] [:db/add "34dbabbc-15c2-56c3-b7ec-71ccc050174d" :answer/id #uuid "34dbabbc-15c2-56c3-b7ec-71ccc050174d"] [:db/add "34dbabbc-15c2-56c3-b7ec-71ccc050174d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "34dbabbc-15c2-56c3-b7ec-71ccc050174d" :answer/value "e^{y - 2}=2 \\left(x + 5\\right)^{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "34dbabbc-15c2-56c3-b7ec-71ccc050174d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6dd9c0c9-ec62-516b-85fe-3b2ec0a8b6f0" :answer/id #uuid "6dd9c0c9-ec62-516b-85fe-3b2ec0a8b6f0"] [:db/add "6dd9c0c9-ec62-516b-85fe-3b2ec0a8b6f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6dd9c0c9-ec62-516b-85fe-3b2ec0a8b6f0" :answer/value "e^{y - 2}=3 \\left(x + 5\\right)^{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "6dd9c0c9-ec62-516b-85fe-3b2ec0a8b6f0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "26137cb8-e918-5ce9-b1fb-a49224f742d1" :answer/id #uuid "26137cb8-e918-5ce9-b1fb-a49224f742d1"] [:db/add "26137cb8-e918-5ce9-b1fb-a49224f742d1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "26137cb8-e918-5ce9-b1fb-a49224f742d1" :answer/value "e^{y - 2}=- \\left(x + 5\\right)^{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "26137cb8-e918-5ce9-b1fb-a49224f742d1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6fe7436e-4be6-500c-9475-57df72c68a31" :answer/id #uuid "6fe7436e-4be6-500c-9475-57df72c68a31"] [:db/add "6fe7436e-4be6-500c-9475-57df72c68a31" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6fe7436e-4be6-500c-9475-57df72c68a31" :answer/value "e^{y - 2}=\\left(x + 5\\right)^{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "6fe7436e-4be6-500c-9475-57df72c68a31" :answer/validate] [:db/add "95c14b72-7237-51b9-8103-a1ca772f4105" :answer-field/id #uuid "95c14b72-7237-51b9-8103-a1ca772f4105"] [:db/add "95c14b72-7237-51b9-8103-a1ca772f4105" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "95c14b72-7237-51b9-8103-a1ca772f4105" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "95c14b72-7237-51b9-8103-a1ca772f4105" :answer-field/choices "65613dad-adcb-552f-b5c3-f9dacd4d0a12"] [:db/add "95c14b72-7237-51b9-8103-a1ca772f4105" :answer-field/choices "34dbabbc-15c2-56c3-b7ec-71ccc050174d"] [:db/add "95c14b72-7237-51b9-8103-a1ca772f4105" :answer-field/choices "6dd9c0c9-ec62-516b-85fe-3b2ec0a8b6f0"] [:db/add "95c14b72-7237-51b9-8103-a1ca772f4105" :answer-field/choices "26137cb8-e918-5ce9-b1fb-a49224f742d1"] [:db/add "95c14b72-7237-51b9-8103-a1ca772f4105" :answer-field/choices "6fe7436e-4be6-500c-9475-57df72c68a31"] [:db/add "95c14b72-7237-51b9-8103-a1ca772f4105" :answer-field/correct "34dbabbc-15c2-56c3-b7ec-71ccc050174d"] [:db/ensure "95c14b72-7237-51b9-8103-a1ca772f4105" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e414420b-974e-5702-bd35-607d710c9d38" :question/id #uuid "e414420b-974e-5702-bd35-607d710c9d38"] [:db/add "e414420b-974e-5702-bd35-607d710c9d38" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\left(4 x + 20\\right) e^{2 - y}.$"] [:db/add "e414420b-974e-5702-bd35-607d710c9d38" :question/worked-solution "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\left(4 x + 20\\right) e^{2 - y} \\\\ (e^{y - 2})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =4 x + 20\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (e^{y - 2})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (4 x + 20)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (e^{y - 2})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\cancel{\\text{d}x}}\\,\\cancel{\\text{d}x} & =\\int (4 x + 20)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (e^{y - 2})\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int (4 x + 20)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ e^{y - 2} & =2 \\left(x + 5\\right)^{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\ne^{y - 2}=2 \\left(x + 5\\right)^{2}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "e414420b-974e-5702-bd35-607d710c9d38" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "e414420b-974e-5702-bd35-607d710c9d38" :question/answer-fields "95c14b72-7237-51b9-8103-a1ca772f4105"] [:db/ensure "e414420b-974e-5702-bd35-607d710c9d38" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068844 :knowledge-point/questions "e414420b-974e-5702-bd35-607d710c9d38"] [:db/add "77812baa-ca7f-51ec-8b26-1968eba43ddb" :answer/id #uuid "77812baa-ca7f-51ec-8b26-1968eba43ddb"] [:db/add "77812baa-ca7f-51ec-8b26-1968eba43ddb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "77812baa-ca7f-51ec-8b26-1968eba43ddb" :answer/value "\\arcsin{\\left(y - 3 \\right)}=- 2 x+C"] [:db/ensure "77812baa-ca7f-51ec-8b26-1968eba43ddb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "edb66c36-2956-5340-9b17-714a9784e244" :answer/id #uuid "edb66c36-2956-5340-9b17-714a9784e244"] [:db/add "edb66c36-2956-5340-9b17-714a9784e244" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "edb66c36-2956-5340-9b17-714a9784e244" :answer/value "\\arcsin{\\left(y - 3 \\right)}=- x+C"] [:db/ensure "edb66c36-2956-5340-9b17-714a9784e244" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4681cc65-906b-5c53-8969-874b8ec69174" :answer/id #uuid "4681cc65-906b-5c53-8