 [:db/add "98eb94b6-6c49-5a95-aced-95c12633a495" :question/id #uuid "98eb94b6-6c49-5a95-aced-95c12633a495"] [:db/add "98eb94b6-6c49-5a95-aced-95c12633a495" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\sqrt{1 - \\left(y - 3\\right)^{2}}$ for $\\,|\\left(y-3\\right)|<1.$"] [:db/add "98eb94b6-6c49-5a95-aced-95c12633a495" :question/worked-solution "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\sqrt{1 - \\left(y - 3\\right)^{2}} \\\\ (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - \\left(y - 3\\right)^{2}}})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - \\left(y - 3\\right)^{2}}})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - \\left(y - 3\\right)^{2}}})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\cancel{\\text{d}x}}\\,\\cancel{\\text{d}x} & =\\int (1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - \\left(y - 3\\right)^{2}}})\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int (1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\arcsin{\\left(y - 3 \\right)} & =x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n\\arcsin{\\left(y - 3 \\right)}=x+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "98eb94b6-6c49-5a95-aced-95c12633a495" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "98eb94b6-6c49-5a95-aced-95c12633a495" :question/answer-fields "7bef3a4e-4f48-5971-9dee-e2d365a8e974"] [:db/ensure "98eb94b6-6c49-5a95-aced-95c12633a495" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068844 :knowledge-point/questions "98eb94b6-6c49-5a95-aced-95c12633a495"] [:db/add "fb797a13-a6ea-58d1-8b4b-aeb7938f3880" :answer/id #uuid "fb797a13-a6ea-58d1-8b4b-aeb7938f3880"] [:db/add "fb797a13-a6ea-58d1-8b4b-aeb7938f3880" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "fb797a13-a6ea-58d1-8b4b-aeb7938f3880" :answer/value "\\tan{\\left(y - 1 \\right)}=x+C"] [:db/ensure "fb797a13-a6ea-58d1-8b4b-aeb7938f3880" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5b80337c-a8d8-5954-881a-6e30c779219c" :answer/id #uuid "5b80337c-a8d8-5954-881a-6e30c779219c"] [:db/add "5b80337c-a8d8-5954-881a-6e30c779219c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5b80337c-a8d8-5954-881a-6e30c779219c" :answer/value "\\tan{\\left(y - 1 \\right)}=3 x+C"] [:db/ensure "5b80337c-a8d8-5954-881a-6e30c779219c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4d1f9dec-ea36-5760-aa71-a248fe6858cc" :answer/id #uuid "4d1f9dec-ea36-5760-aa71-a248fe6858cc"] [:db/add "4d1f9dec-ea36-5760-aa71-a248fe6858cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4d1f9dec-ea36-5760-aa71-a248fe6858cc" :answer/value "\\tan{\\left(y - 1 \\right)}=- 2 x+C"] [:db/ensure "4d1f9dec-ea36-5760-aa71-a248fe6858cc" :answer/validate] [:db/add "cb2c70e7-64db-5ac9-8a8a-7385d1eaa8d0" :answer/id #uuid "cb2c70e7-64db-5ac9-8a8a-7385d1eaa8d0"] [:db/add "cb2c70e7-64db-5ac9-8a8a-7385d1eaa8d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "cb2c70e7-64db-5ac9-8a8a-7385d1eaa8d0" :answer/value "\\tan{\\left(y - 1 \\right)}=- x+C"] [:db/ensure "cb2c70e7-64db-5ac9-8a8a-7385d1eaa8d0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6f91dfad-227a-50ff-8d6f-06a3c27249b7" :answer/id #uuid "6f91dfad-227a-50ff-8d6f-06a3c27249b7"] [:db/add "6f91dfad-227a-50ff-8d6f-06a3c27249b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6f91dfad-227a-50ff-8d6f-06a3c27249b7" :answer/value "\\tan{\\left(y - 1 \\right)}=2 x+C"] [:db/ensure "6f91dfad-227a-50ff-8d6f-06a3c27249b7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "60fd060d-b7e8-5351-be92-90bb8b43d43a" :answer-field/id #uuid "60fd060d-b7e8-5351-be92-90bb8b43d43a"] [:db/add "60fd060d-b7e8-5351-be92-90bb8b43d43a" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "60fd060d-b7e8-5351-be92-90bb8b43d43a" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "60fd060d-b7e8-5351-be92-90bb8b43d43a" :answer-field/choices "fb797a13-a6ea-58d1-8b4b-aeb7938f3880"] [:db/add "60fd060d-b7e8-5351-be92-90bb8b43d43a" :answer-field/choices "5b80337c-a8d8-5954-881a-6e30c779219c"] [:db/add "60fd060d-b7e8-5351-be92-90bb8b43d43a" :answer-field/choices "4d1f9dec-ea36-5760-aa71-a248fe6858cc"] [:db/add "60fd060d-b7e8-5351-be92-90bb8b43d43a" :answer-field/choices "cb2c70e7-64db-5ac9-8a8a-7385d1eaa8d0"] [:db/add "60fd060d-b7e8-5351-be92-90bb8b43d43a" :answer-field/choices "6f91dfad-227a-50ff-8d6f-06a3c27249b7"] [:db/add "60fd060d-b7e8-5351-be92-90bb8b43d43a" :answer-field/correct "6f91dfad-227a-50ff-8d6f-06a3c27249b7"] [:db/ensure "60fd060d-b7e8-5351-be92-90bb8b43d43a" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "461967d1-8106-5690-8e41-619893730384" :question/id #uuid "461967d1-8106-5690-8e41-619893730384"] [:db/add "461967d1-8106-5690-8e41-619893730384" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=2 \\cos^{2}{\\left(y - 1 \\right)}$ for $-\\frac{\\pi }{2}<\\left(y-1\\right)<\\frac{\\pi }{2}.$"] [:db/add "461967d1-8106-5690-8e41-619893730384" :question/worked-solution "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =2 \\cos^{2}{\\left(y - 1 \\right)} \\\\ (\\sec^{2}{\\left(y - 1 \\right)})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (\\sec^{2}{\\left(y - 1 \\right)})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (2)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (\\sec^{2}{\\left(y - 1 \\right)})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\cancel{\\text{d}x}}\\,\\cancel{\\text{d}x} & =\\int (2)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (\\sec^{2}{\\left(y - 1 \\right)})\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int (2)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\tan{\\left(y - 1 \\right)} & =2 x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n\\tan{\\left(y - 1 \\right)}=2 x+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "461967d1-8106-5690-8e41-619893730384" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "461967d1-8106-5690-8e41-619893730384" :question/answer-fields "60fd060d-b7e8-5351-be92-90bb8b43d43a"] [:db/ensure "461967d1-8106-5690-8e41-619893730384" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068844 :knowledge-point/questions "461967d1-8106-5690-8e41-619893730384"] [:db/add "9cf932c7-9c4b-5af3-a737-4a19ffa61c19" :answer/id #uuid "9cf932c7-9c4b-5af3-a737-4a19ffa61c19"] [:db/add "9cf932c7-9c4b-5af3-a737-4a19ffa61c19" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9cf932c7-9c4b-5af3-a737-4a19ffa61c19" :answer/value "e^{y + 4}=- 2 \\left(x - 3\\right)^{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "9cf932c7-9c4b-5af3-a737-4a19ffa61c19" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8eb864ea-b06f-5970-b44a-e0cf169dfad2" :answer/id #uuid "8eb864ea-b06f-5970-b44a-e0cf169dfad2"] [:db/add "8eb864ea-b06f-5970-b44a-e0cf169dfad2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8eb864ea-b06f-5970-b44a-e0cf169dfad2" :answer/value "e^{y + 4}=\\left(x - 3\\right)^{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "8eb864ea-b06f-5970-b44a-e0cf169dfad2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d7e71904-5acc-5fa1-91a1-acb20f519d18" :answer/id #uuid "d7e71904-5acc-5fa1-91a1-acb20f519d18"] [:db/add "d7e71904-5acc-5fa1-91a1-acb20f519d18" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d7e71904-5acc-5fa1-91a1-acb20f519d18" :answer/value "e^{y + 4}=2 \\left(x - 3\\right)^{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "d7e71904-5acc-5fa1-91a1-acb20f519d18" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4029d02d-b992-5899-80f5-2554751a5818" :answer/id #uuid "4029d02d-b992-5899-80f5-2554751a5818"] [:db/add "4029d02d-b992-5899-80f5-2554751a5818" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4029d02d-b992-5899-80f5-2554751a5818" :answer/value "e^{y + 4}=3 \\left(x - 3\\right)^{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "4029d02d-b992-5899-80f5-2554751a5818" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1e08556e-fe3a-5878-b374-961b439e063d" :answer/id #uuid "1e08556e-fe3a-5878-b374-961b439e063d"] [:db/add "1e08556e-fe3a-5878-b374-961b439e063d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1e08556e-fe3a-5878-b374-961b439e063d" :answer/value "e^{y + 4}=- \\left(x - 3\\right)^{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "1e08556e-fe3a-5878-b374-961b439e063d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f08142dc-d542-59d8-b38e-e6dccfcfe24b" :answer-field/id #uuid "f08142dc-d542-59d8-b38e-e6dccfcfe24b"] [:db/add "f08142dc-d542-59d8-b38e-e6dccfcfe24b" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "f08142dc-d542-59d8-b38e-e6dccfcfe24b" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "f08142dc-d542-59d8-b38e-e6dccfcfe24b" :answer-field/choices "9cf932c7-9c4b-5af3-a737-4a19ffa61c19"] [:db/add "f08142dc-d542-59d8-b38e-e6dccfcfe24b" :answer-field/choices "8eb864ea-b06f-5970-b44a-e0cf169dfad2"] [:db/add "f08142dc-d542-59d8-b38e-e6dccfcfe24b" :answer-field/choices "d7e71904-5acc-5fa1-91a1-acb20f519d18"] [:db/add "f08142dc-d542-59d8-b38e-e6dccfcfe24b" :answer-field/choices "4029d02d-b992-5899-80f5-2554751a5818"] [:db/add "f08142dc-d542-59d8-b38e-e6dccfcfe24b" :answer-field/choices "1e08556e-fe3a-5878-b374-961b439e063d"] [:db/add "f08142dc-d542-59d8-b38e-e6dccfcfe24b" :answer-field/correct "9cf932c7-9c4b-5af3-a737-4a19ffa61c19"] [:db/ensure "f08142dc-d542-59d8-b38e-e6dccfcfe24b" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e2cf29a2-5dd5-58a3-9067-e59917e63171" :question/id #uuid "e2cf29a2-5dd5-58a3-9067-e59917e63171"] [:db/add "e2cf29a2-5dd5-58a3-9067-e59917e63171" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\left(12 - 4 x\\right) e^{- y - 4}.$"] [:db/add "e2cf29a2-5dd5-58a3-9067-e59917e63171" :question/worked-solution "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\left(12 - 4 x\\right) e^{- y - 4} \\\\ (e^{y + 4})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =12 - 4 x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (e^{y + 4})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (12 - 4 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (e^{y + 4})\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\cancel{\\text{d}x}}\\,\\cancel{\\text{d}x} & =\\int (12 - 4 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (e^{y + 4})\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int (12 - 4 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ e^{y + 4} & =- 2 \\left(x - 3\\right)^{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\ne^{y + 4}=- 2 \\left(x - 3\\right)^{2}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "e2cf29a2-5dd5-58a3-9067-e59917e63171" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "e2cf29a2-5dd5-58a3-9067-e59917e63171" :question/answer-fields "f08142dc-d542-59d8-b38e-e6dccfcfe24b"] [:db/ensure "e2cf29a2-5dd5-58a3-9067-e59917e63171" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068844 :knowledge-point/questions "e2cf29a2-5dd5-58a3-9067-e59917e63171"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "a72df626-3fff-5826-8a69-cad1384c6fc6"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/8f/8f695b7824fce9f38e037f40fb880ba2b30f24edf2ab9a3b196c6bd3e55626e1/17592186068844.py"] [:db/add 17592186068844 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186068844 :knowledge-point/validate]]
